From: Paul Philippov <paul@themactep.com>
Subject: [PATCH] media: i2c: add the OmniVision OS03B10 sensor driver

Add a mainline V4L2 subdev driver for the OmniVision OS03B10 image
sensor. The mode register sequence and gain table are adapted from the
Ingenic vendor sensor driver (sensor_os03b10_t31).

The driver uses the CCI register helpers, runtime PM, and the current
state-based subdev pad API. It exposes the full-resolution mode with
HBLANK/VBLANK, exposure, analogue gain, and mirror/flip controls where
the vendor driver provides them.

Signed-off-by: Paul Philippov <paul@themactep.com>
---
--- /dev/null
+++ b/drivers/media/i2c/os03b10.c
@@ -0,0 +1,917 @@
